Third-party code
----------------

FLUX.2 (Black Forest Labs), Apache License 2.0
https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-base-4B

  geocr/models/flux2.py      Transformer blocks, modulation, normalisation, rotary position
                             embedding and timestep embedding of FLUX.2. MODIFIED: only the
                             components used by GeoCR are kept.
  geocr/models/flux2_ae.py   The FLUX.2 autoencoder. MODIFIED: the encoder returns the
                             posterior mean, packed 2x2 space-to-depth and normalised by the
                             shipped BatchNorm statistics; the module is always frozen.
  geocr/models/multistem_ae.py
                             Input and output stems placed around the frozen FLUX.2
                             autoencoder trunks.
  geocr/models/geocr_dit.py  The GeoCR flow transformer, built from the blocks above and
                             initialised from FLUX.2 [klein] 4B Base for pretraining.


